4. Three public books (credit only, nothing copied)

The 93 assets in evals/retrieval/assets/books/library were written for an earlier
akm experiment, E6, which indexed three public books beside them. They copy no
passage from those books: at most 11 of the 4,326 six-word sequences of a
domain's assets occur in its book, and those are standard terms or definitions.
The assets are MPL-2.0 like the rest of this repository. The books are credited
